      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3710,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 100,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• Agents (LLMs) can’t actually do any of these steps autonomously\n• Humans don’t want to sign up just to call your API once\n• Tiny payments ($0.001) are economically impossible with credit cards\n• You can’t price compute or AI inference per-call without massive infrastructure",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Agents (LLMs) can’t actually do any of these steps autonomously\n• Humans don’t want to sign up just to call your API once\n• Tiny payments ($0.001) are economically impossible with credit cards\n• You can’t price compute or AI inference per-call without massive infrastructure",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "as"
    },
