      "y": 1430,
      "width": 407.8394775390625,
      "height": 120,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "text": "Each (wallet, mint) pair has a deterministic ATA address.\n\nIf the recipient ATA doesn’t exist yet, your tx must create it.\n\nUse createAssociatedTokenAccountIdempotent — \n safe to include every time.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each (wallet, mint) pair has a deterministic ATA address.\n\nIf the recipient ATA doesn’t exist yet, your tx must create it.\n\nUse createAssociatedTokenAccountIdempotent — \n safe to include every time.",
