      "height": 100,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "text": "Client signs as token sender. Facilitator signs as feePayer.\n\nResult: client never needs SOL — only USDC.\n\nHuge UX win for agents and new users.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client signs as token sender. Facilitator signs as feePayer.\n\nResult: client never needs SOL — only USDC.\n\nHuge UX win for agents and new users.",
